### States and keyboard
| State | How it works |
|---|---|
| Default | Hairline border, raised surface. |
| Hover | Border becomes `--color-border-strong`, lifts 1px with a shadow, no layout shift. |
| Focus-visible | A 2px ring on every control. On the card it shows around the whole card when the title button has keyboard focus. |
| Selected | `aria-pressed="true"` on the title button, subtle surface, focus-colour border, check icon. Selection is not colour alone. |
| Disabled | The `Open` button is `disabled` (opacity .5, `not-allowed`). An archived card cannot be selected and does not lift. |
| Loading | Three skeletons with the same `min-height` as a card, `aria-busy="true"` on the grid, shimmer paused under reduced motion. |
| Empty filter | A panel that names the filter text, with `Reset filters` (44px). It clears the input and returns focus to it. |
| Error | A `role="alert"` panel inline in the grid, with `Retry`. The filter text stays as typed. |

- **Keyboard:** `Tab` moves through the filter input, the title buttons and the `Open` buttons. `Space` or `Enter` toggles selection.
- **Reduced motion:** the lift, the transitions and the shimmer are switched off. Selection and focus feedback still show.
- **SVG:** icons use `currentColor` and `aria-hidden="true"`.

### Open questions and next
- **Real data:** the card copy is placeholder. Supply real field names and the fetch call if you want them wired in.
- **Palette:** the neutral default palette is assumed, with no foundation. If you want brand tokens, `design-system` builds them. This skill then reads `design/tokens.css` and uses those variables.
- **Optional follow-ups:** `a11y-audit` for a markup-level WCAG pass, or `QA_AUDITOR` for responsive and keyboard checks.
- **Live run:** the skill's live-eval recording is not part of this reply.

